# -*-cperl-*-

=head1 NAME

_CALCULATE_FIVEPOINT_POINTING_

=head1 DESCRIPTION

=head1 ARGUMENTS

None.

=head1 NOTES

=over 4

=item *

This primitive is suitable for ACSIS pointing observations.

=back

=head1 OUTPUT DATA

=over 4

=item RESULT

Array containing (daz, del) if successful, undef otherwise.

=back

=head1 TASKS

FIGARO: FITPOLY.
KAPPA: NDFCOPY, SETAXIS, WCSATTRIB.

=head1 REQUIRED PERL MODULES

None.

